{"dog":{"age_group":"young","application_url":"https://heartsandbonesrescue.org/register-to-adopt","availability_detail":"available","breed_display":"Retriever","breed_primary":"Retriever","description_text":"Gustave is a sweet and goofy guy. At 1 year old, this roughly 20 pound, mixed breed angel is coming out of his shell more and more every day.\n\nHe may seem shy when you first meet him, but his tail will wag nonstop once he’s comfortable. And the more comfortable he gets, the more his goofy side will come through.\n\nGustave would be a great fit for a patient adopter who's willing to let him get comfortable on his own schedule. He's still working on his leash skills and is making great progress as his confidence continues to grow. And as that confidence grows, you’ll see the loving, joyful personality his foster is already obsessed with.\n\nRegistered adopters interested in Gustave can email adopt@hbrdogs.com for more info. If you're not registered yet, do it today at hbrdogs.com.","detail_url":"https://new.shelterluv.com/embed/animal/HBR-A-123315","id":"b74e5d430f71d4951f1aba030e74eb04","image_urls":["https://new-s3.shelterluv.com/profile-pictures/d50cf9f4d37c063f6176544952a7ea01/d12b21ce5753e7aa0732b4d4efe8275d.jpg","https://new-s3.shelterluv.com/profile-pictures/9bc21aff2b75383edc3fd027f97c7dd2/4570e9b980fcb640756d15926cdd481b.jpeg","https://new-s3.shelterluv.com/profile-pictures/b258e6a393473606dc2b51a936624c10/e16c5b8ed2989124d2b3dbfb7ad0cfc7.jpeg","https://new-s3.shelterluv.com/profile-pictures/873a8ea3fc0e5888760729ebf35a470a/42bd3aeeefb1f7d510647f3031859cb3.jpeg","https://new-s3.shelterluv.com/profile-pictures/db41e2c23795c669eec61def4f3da6d4/7cd9172f0c24aba81a013b1fcf126844.jpeg","https://new-s3.shelterluv.com/profile-pictures/e56983ffab721c91cdea66ad346591b3/42225968cd5bc0dafbb0798af015ad39.jpeg","https://new-s3.shelterluv.com/profile-pictures/cf10fb2b44e51915514383b696276ac0/f63ffec52155c7bfd51da04f44c4198a.jpeg","https://new-s3.shelterluv.com/profil